Subject: [PATCH 6.1 0396/1146] media: mt9p031: Drop bogus v4l2_subdev_get_try_crop() call from mt9p031_init_cfg()
Date: Wed, 28 Dec 2022 15:32:15 +0100
Message-Id: <20221228144340.920957823@linuxfoundation.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.39.0
In-Reply-To: <20221228144330.180012208@linuxfoundation.org>
